  "referenceNumber": "BEL0033",
  "remarks": "\nLidzia Yarmoshina was the Chairperson of the Central Electoral Commission of the Belarusian Regime until December 2021. In her role as Chairperson, she was responsible for the actions of the CEC, including upholding a fraudulent election result and blocking the participation of rival candidates in the election. \n",
